{"slug":"图网络基本属性","title":"图网络基本属性","date":"2020-10-02","tags":["图神经网络"],"summary":"如何描述一个网络Degree DistributionP(k): 随机选择的节点， 度为k的的概率分布， 使用直方图来描述 其中 N_k 表示度为k的节点数， 比如上图中，度为1的节点数有6， 所有节点数为10， 所以 P(6)=0.6 Path LengthPath: path是指每个节点连接下一个节点的序…","content":"<h2>如何描述一个网络</h2><h3>Degree Distribution</h3><p data-pid=\"oTOkQ1G9\">P(k): 随机选择的节点， 度为k的的概率分布， 使用直方图来描述</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-3fb6402e51e3185f8b96104a57fca6fb_1440w.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1279\" data-rawheight=\"455\" data-original-token=\"v2-3fb6402e51e3185f8b96104a57fca6fb\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1279\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-3fb6402e51e3185f8b96104a57fca6fb_r.jpg\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"F0ieQkeg\"> 其中 <img src=\"https://www.zhihu.com/equation?tex=N_k\" alt=\"N_k\" eeimg=\"1\"/> 表示度为k的节点数， 比如上图中，度为1的节点数有6， 所有节点数为10， 所以 <img src=\"https://www.zhihu.com/equation?tex=P%286%29%3D0.6\" alt=\"P(6)=0.6\" eeimg=\"1\"/> </p><h3>Path Length</h3><p data-pid=\"c5zUNfod\">Path: path是指每个节点连接下一个节点的序列，其中，一个path能够重复多次相同的边， 如下图： ACBDCDEG </p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-7cbdf7e16a081a312021650ab2829161_1440w.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"504\" data-rawheight=\"271\" data-original-token=\"v2-7cbdf7e16a081a312021650ab2829161\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"504\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-7cbdf7e16a081a312021650ab2829161_r.jpg\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"ej6x-mGv\">Distance: 连接节点对最少数量的边，称为两个节点间的distance，如下图，其中 <img src=\"https://www.zhihu.com/equation?tex=h_%7BB%2CD%7D%3D2%2C+h_%7BA%2CX%7D%3D%5Cinfty\" alt=\"h_{B,D}=2, h_{A,X}=\\infty\" eeimg=\"1\"/> ， 若图中两节点无连接，或中间连接断开，则distance为无穷，在有向图中，distance的计算应该考虑两个节点间的方向，如下图 <img src=\"https://www.zhihu.com/equation?tex=h_%7BB%2CC%7D%3D1%2C+h_%7BC%2CB%7D%3D2\" alt=\"h_{B,C}=1, h_{C,B}=2\" eeimg=\"1\"/> ，不是对称的： </p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-d7a6b2bae391a9d2f7b2e0f87b1abc7d_1440w.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"362\" data-rawheight=\"274\" data-original-token=\"v2-d7a6b2bae391a9d2f7b2e0f87b1abc7d\" class=\"content_image\" width=\"362\"/></figure><figure data-size=\"normal\"><img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-f9836a10dd7c88b81a155f525fab4ef5_1440w.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"305\" data-rawheight=\"285\" data-original-token=\"v2-f9836a10dd7c88b81a155f525fab4ef5\" class=\"content_image\" width=\"305\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"HECEADJs\"><b>Diameter</b>在graph中，所有节点对当中最长distance； <b>Average path length</b>针对graph来说， average path length计算公式如下： </p><p data-pid=\"8BnVRTh9\"><img src=\"https://www.zhihu.com/equation?tex=h_%7Baverage%7D%3D%5Cfrac%7B%5Csum_%7Bi%2Cj%21%3Di+h_%7Bij%7D%7D%7D%7B2E_%7Bmax%7D%7D\" alt=\"h_{average}=\\frac{\\sum_{i,j!=i h_{ij}}}{2E_{max}}\" eeimg=\"1\"/> </p><p data-pid=\"Gb0UraSt\">其中 <img src=\"https://www.zhihu.com/equation?tex=h_%7Bij%7D\" alt=\"h_{ij}\" eeimg=\"1\"/> 是node i到node j的distance, <img src=\"https://www.zhihu.com/equation?tex=E_%7Bmax%7D\" alt=\"E_{max}\" eeimg=\"1\"/> 是指图最多可存在的边数： <img src=\"https://www.zhihu.com/equation?tex=%5Cfrac%7Bn%28n-1%29%7D%7B2%7D\" alt=\"\\frac{n(n-1)}{2}\" eeimg=\"1\"/> </p><h3>Cluster coefficient</h3><p data-pid=\"bMzB3KRQ\"><b>cluster coefficient</b> 对于无向图，用来描述节点i与他的邻居的链接情况， 其中节点i的度为<img src=\"https://www.zhihu.com/equation?tex=k_%7Bi%7D\" alt=\"k_{i}\" eeimg=\"1\"/> ，clustering coefficient计算公式如下： </p><p data-pid=\"4pqT2lIR\"><img src=\"https://www.zhihu.com/equation?tex=C_%7Bi%7D%3D%5Cfrac%7B2e_%7Bi%7D%7D%7Bk_%7Bi%7D%28k_%7Bi%7D-1%29%7D\" alt=\"C_{i}=\\frac{2e_{i}}{k_{i}(k_{i}-1)}\" eeimg=\"1\"/> </p><p data-pid=\"DDMzNrUJ\"> 如下图， 图的node i的cluster coefficient计算如下： <img src=\"https://www.zhihu.com/equation?tex=C_%7Bi%7D%3D%5Cfrac%7B2%2A6%7D%7B4%2A%284-1%29%7D%3D1%2C+C_%7Bi%7D%3D%5Cfrac%7B%282%2A3%29%7D%7B4%2A%284-1%29%7D%3D0.5%2C+C_%7Bi%7D%3D%5Cfrac%7B2%2A0%7D%7B4%2A%284-1%29%7D%3D0\" alt=\"C_{i}=\\frac{2*6}{4*(4-1)}=1, C_{i}=\\frac{(2*3)}{4*(4-1)}=0.5, C_{i}=\\frac{2*0}{4*(4-1)}=0\" eeimg=\"1\"/> </p><p data-pid=\"VzKXsMrW\">Average clustering coefficient: <img src=\"https://www.zhihu.com/equation?tex=C%3D%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BN%7D%5Csum_%7Bi%7D%5E%7BN%7DC_%7Bi%7D\" alt=\"C=\\frac{1}{N}\\sum_{i}^{N}C_{i}\" eeimg=\"1\"/> </p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-d4a7f4b74c0b02ffefe553a6efa2d3b9_1440w.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"621\" data-rawheight=\"161\" data-original-token=\"v2-d4a7f4b74c0b02ffefe553a6efa2d3b9\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"621\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-d4a7f4b74c0b02ffefe553a6efa2d3b9_r.jpg\"/></figure><figure data-size=\"normal\"><img src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-a40ef0707f8c27f4bd9dc49ec4771812_1440w.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"528\" data-rawheight=\"260\" data-original-token=\"v2-a40ef0707f8c27f4bd9dc49ec4771812\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"528\" data-original=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-a40ef0707f8c27f4bd9dc49ec4771812_r.jpg\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"wkrG8Q6V\"><img src=\"https://www.zhihu.com/equation?tex=K_%7BA%7D%3D1%2C+e_%7BA%7D%3D0%2C+C_%7BA%7D%3D0\" alt=\"K_{A}=1, e_{A}=0, C_{A}=0\" eeimg=\"1\"/> </p><p data-pid=\"d2MV7wdf\"><img src=\"https://www.zhihu.com/equation?tex=k_%7BB%7D%3D2%2C+e_%7BB%7D%3D1%2C+C_%7BB%7D%3D1\" alt=\"k_{B}=2, e_{B}=1, C_{B}=1\" eeimg=\"1\"/></p><p data-pid=\"Qxbg_tjZ\"><img src=\"https://www.zhihu.com/equation?tex=k_%7BC%7D%3D4%2C+e_%7BC%7D%3D2%2C+C_%7BC%7D%3D1%2F3\" alt=\"k_{C}=4, e_{C}=2, C_{C}=1/3\" eeimg=\"1\"/></p><p data-pid=\"5KvYIJj7\"><img src=\"https://www.zhihu.com/equation?tex=k_%7BD%7D%3D4%2C+e_%7BD%7D%3D2%2C+C_%7BD%7D%3D1%2F3\" alt=\"k_{D}=4, e_{D}=2, C_{D}=1/3\" eeimg=\"1\"/> </p><p data-pid=\"KaxEwFQH\"><img src=\"https://www.zhihu.com/equation?tex=k_%7BE%7D%3D3%2C+e_%7BE%7D%3D0%2C+C_%7BE%7D%3D0\" alt=\"k_{E}=3, e_{E}=0, C_{E}=0\" eeimg=\"1\"/> </p><p data-pid=\"NPxE2pzb\"><img src=\"https://www.zhihu.com/equation?tex=k_%7BF%7D%3D1%2C+e_%7BF%7D%3D0%2C+C_%7BF%7D%3D0\" alt=\"k_{F}=1, e_{F}=0, C_{F}=0\" eeimg=\"1\"/> </p><p data-pid=\"0XNLAvpu\"><img src=\"https://www.zhihu.com/equation?tex=k_%7BG%7D%3D1%2C+e_%7BG%7D%3D0%2C+C_%7BG%7D%3D0\" alt=\"k_{G}=1, e_{G}=0, C_{G}=0\" eeimg=\"1\"/> </p><p data-pid=\"rgcDFONS\"><img src=\"https://www.zhihu.com/equation?tex=k_%7BH%7D%3D2%2C+e_%7BH%7D%3D1%2C+C_%7BH%7D%3D1\" alt=\"k_{H}=2, e_{H}=1, C_{H}=1\" eeimg=\"1\"/> </p><p data-pid=\"g1o3UMni\">avg. clustering: C= (1+1/3+1/3+1)/8=1/3</p><h3>Connected components</h3><p data-pid=\"I3xWUzGO\"><b>Connectivity</b> 图当中最大的可连接的component：能够通过path链接的任意两个几点的最大的集合； 如何找到图当中的connect components，从图中随机节点开始，按广度优先策略遍历，标记遍历过的节点，如果，所有的节点均被遍历，那么这个未connected component， 否则从未遍历的节点中随机开始，重复广度优先策略遍历；</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-964c234c6be1bb9d9e363c118235f7ad_1440w.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"347\" data-rawheight=\"369\" data-original-token=\"v2-964c234c6be1bb9d9e363c118235f7ad\" class=\"content_image\" width=\"347\"/></figure><h2>描述实际中的图：MSN Messenger</h2><p data-pid=\"CIcZtkOq\">msn一个月的相关的数据，如下： </p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-8d538ddacf0b858dc1d0479c43971adf_1440w.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1175\" data-rawheight=\"765\" data-original-token=\"v2-8d538ddacf0b858dc1d0479c43971adf\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1175\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-8d538ddacf0b858dc1d0479c43971adf_r.jpg\"/></figure><h3>Degree Distribution</h3><figure data-size=\"normal\"><img src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-2703d7aaad8c1722a0d313e5fd60179e_1440w.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1181\" data-rawheight=\"735\" data-original-token=\"v2-2703d7aaad8c1722a0d313e5fd60179e\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1181\" data-original=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-2703d7aaad8c1722a0d313e5fd60179e_r.jpg\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"0JTJhI-r\"> x坐标log之后： </p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-da099f8c88b5811ed68240d49c99a7a3_1440w.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1194\" data-rawheight=\"799\" data-original-token=\"v2-da099f8c88b5811ed68240d49c99a7a3\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1194\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-da099f8c88b5811ed68240d49c99a7a3_r.jpg\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"2SanbgFW\"> 可见大部分的节点degress在个位数。</p><h3>Clustering</h3><p data-pid=\"xl6kn_Z0\">将所有的节点的k与c绘制在如下图中，整个graph的avg culstering coefficient约为0.1140 </p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-2bd78d10d600b1c40351fb1e6790a64f_1440w.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"980\" data-rawheight=\"679\" data-original-token=\"v2-2bd78d10d600b1c40351fb1e6790a64f\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"980\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-2bd78d10d600b1c40351fb1e6790a64f_r.jpg\"/></figure><h3>Connected Components</h3><figure data-size=\"normal\"><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-23731536eb6dd59a59ac288f302fd6d4_1440w.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1090\" data-rawheight=\"729\" data-original-token=\"v2-23731536eb6dd59a59ac288f302fd6d4\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1090\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-23731536eb6dd59a59ac288f302fd6d4_r.jpg\"/></figure><h3>Diameter</h3><p data-pid=\"1ph5yDw_\">msn的graph中平均path length为6.6， 90% 的节点能够触及在8个链接后触及到另一节点； </p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><img src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-8f0fd1626afc80cd4ecaecdedc7f3be6_1440w.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1010\" data-rawheight=\"835\" data-original-token=\"v2-8f0fd1626afc80cd4ecaecdedc7f3be6\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1010\" data-original=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-8f0fd1626afc80cd4ecaecdedc7f3be6_r.jpg\"/></figure><h3>图的核心属性如何使用？</h3><p data-pid=\"TC9QBmoV\">这些graph的属性是意外的还是在我们本身预料之中？ </p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-88d1f79319601a465b714441c036c805_1440w.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1222\" data-rawheight=\"853\" data-original-token=\"v2-88d1f79319601a465b714441c036c805\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1222\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-88d1f79319601a465b714441c036c805_r.jpg\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"FEat7QlE\"><b>PPI Network</b></p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-30aaede9bbcca38ba4ff58e40bfb14cb_1440w.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1381\" data-rawheight=\"790\" data-original-token=\"v2-30aaede9bbcca38ba4ff58e40bfb14cb\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1381\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-30aaede9bbcca38ba4ff58e40bfb14cb_r.jpg\"/></figure><h2>Random Graph Model</h2><h3>Simplest Model of Graph</h3><p data-pid=\"EwMOTCcp\"><b>ER Random Graphs</b> 两个变种： </p><p data-pid=\"vGadjpnT\">1. <img src=\"https://www.zhihu.com/equation?tex=G_%7Bnp%7D\" alt=\"G_{np}\" eeimg=\"1\"/> ： n个节点的无向图，其中每一条边是概率为p的独立同分布； </p><p data-pid=\"K90s0F2x\">2. <img src=\"https://www.zhihu.com/equation?tex=G_%7Bmn%7D\" alt=\"G_{mn}\" eeimg=\"1\"/> : n个节点的无向图，其中m个边均匀随机生成；</p><p data-pid=\"LCBqGgHG\">需要说明的是，n, p 无法唯一地的决定graph，如下图，相同的n,p下， 我们有不同的图： </p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-321e0d8841adec399bbee6a52f2a4fdd_1440w.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1241\" data-rawheight=\"328\" data-original-token=\"v2-321e0d8841adec399bbee6a52f2a4fdd\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1241\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-321e0d8841adec399bbee6a52f2a4fdd_r.jpg\"/></figure><h3>Degree Distribution of <img src=\"https://www.zhihu.com/equation?tex=G_%7Bnp%7D\" alt=\"G_{np}\" eeimg=\"1\"/> </h3><p data-pid=\"aKATUW0S\">假定<img src=\"https://www.zhihu.com/equation?tex=P%7B%28k%29%7D\" alt=\"P{(k)}\" eeimg=\"1\"/> 表示度为k在所有节点中的占比， 则 </p><p data-pid=\"dIh6k9js\"><img src=\"https://www.zhihu.com/equation?tex=%5Calpha\" alt=\"\\alpha\" eeimg=\"1\"/> <img src=\"https://www.zhihu.com/equation?tex=P_%7B%28k%29%7D%3D+C_%7Bn-1%7D%5E%7Bk%7D+p%5E%7Bk%7D%281-p%29%5E%7Bn-1-k%7D\" alt=\"P_{(k)}= C_{n-1}^{k} p^{k}(1-p)^{n-1-k}\" eeimg=\"1\"/> </p><p data-pid=\"Boy1BFrJ\">很明显的binomial distribution, 所以均值、方差为：</p><p data-pid=\"M8vqjU_B\"><img src=\"https://www.zhihu.com/equation?tex=k_mean+%3D+p%28n-1%29\" alt=\"k_mean = p(n-1)\" eeimg=\"1\"/> </p><p data-pid=\"8c9rjYK3\"><img src=\"https://www.zhihu.com/equation?tex=%5Csigma%5E2+%3D+p%281-p%29%28n-1%29\" alt=\"\\sigma^2 = p(1-p)(n-1)\" eeimg=\"1\"/> </p><p data-pid=\"u90FkJaD\">标准差率为： <img src=\"https://www.zhihu.com/equation?tex=%5Cfrac%7B%5Csigma%7D%7Bk_mean%7D+%5Capprox+%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%28n-1%29%5E%7B0.5%7D%7D\" alt=\"\\frac{\\sigma}{k_mean} \\approx \\frac{1}{(n-1)^{0.5}}\" eeimg=\"1\"/> ，当图无限大的时候，则标准差为0， 所有的节点都为 <img src=\"https://www.zhihu.com/equation?tex=k_%7Bmean%7D\" alt=\"k_{mean}\" eeimg=\"1\"/> 。</p><h3>Clustering Coefficient of  <img src=\"https://www.zhihu.com/equation?tex=G_%7Bnp%7D\" alt=\"G_{np}\" eeimg=\"1\"/></h3><p data-pid=\"Wz6PvKXe\">已知 <img src=\"https://www.zhihu.com/equation?tex=C_%7Bi%7D%3D%5Cfrac%7B2e_%7Bi%7D%7D%7Bk_%7Bi%7D%28k_%7Bi%7D-1%29%7D%2C+G_%7Bnp%7D\" alt=\"C_{i}=\\frac{2e_{i}}{k_{i}(k_{i}-1)}, G_{np}\" eeimg=\"1\"/> 边为概率为p的独立同步分， 其中 <img src=\"https://www.zhihu.com/equation?tex=E%5Be_%7Bi%7D%5D+%3D+p%5Cfrac%7Bk_%7Bi%7D%28k_%7Bi%7D-1%29%7D%7B2%7D\" alt=\"E[e_{i}] = p\\frac{k_{i}(k_{i}-1)}{2}\" eeimg=\"1\"/> , 故<img src=\"https://www.zhihu.com/equation?tex=E%5BC_i%5D+%3D+%5Cfrac%7Bpk_i%28k_i+-+1%29%7D%7Bk_i%28k_i+-1%29%7D+%3D+p+%3D+%5Cfrac%7Bk_%7Bavg%7D%7D%7Bn-1%7D+%5Capprox+%5Cfrac%7Bk_%7Bavg%7D%7D%7Bn%7D\" alt=\"E[C_i] = \\frac{pk_i(k_i - 1)}{k_i(k_i -1)} = p = \\frac{k_{avg}}{n-1} \\approx \\frac{k_{avg}}{n}\" eeimg=\"1\"/> </p><p data-pid=\"RU6fmlx_\"><b>Expansion</b></p><p data-pid=\"2J8cD6bS\">定义<img src=\"https://www.zhihu.com/equation?tex=%5Calpha\" alt=\"\\alpha\" eeimg=\"1\"/> : 如果一个graph的任意的子集S,子集中边的条数大于alpha乘以子集或者graph去除子集之后的节点数量， Expansion通常用来衡量图的鲁棒性： </p><p data-pid=\"AM84xGoS\"><img src=\"https://www.zhihu.com/equation?tex=%5Calpha+%3D+%5Cmathop%7B%5Cmin%7D_%7BS+%5Csubseteqq%7D%7B%5Cfrac%7B%5C%23+edges%5C++leaving%5C+S%7D+%7Bmin%28%7Cs%7C%2C+%7CV+%5C+S%7C%29%7D%7D\" alt=\"\\alpha = \\mathop{\\min}_{S \\subseteqq}{\\frac{\\# edges\\  leaving\\ S} {min(|s|, |V \\ S|)}}\" eeimg=\"1\"/> </p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-3756fa9a00e34c4b90483e6454f9fb8a_1440w.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"446\" data-rawheight=\"423\" data-original-token=\"v2-3756fa9a00e34c4b90483e6454f9fb8a\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"446\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-3756fa9a00e34c4b90483e6454f9fb8a_r.jpg\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"8qt240fN\"> 这张ppt没理解清楚， </p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-fe9b717b85e992b37f3ac6e79b297476_1440w.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1264\" data-rawheight=\"804\" data-original-token=\"v2-fe9b717b85e992b37f3ac6e79b297476\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1264\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-fe9b717b85e992b37f3ac6e79b297476_r.jpg\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"RVNLVdCr\"> 在<img src=\"https://www.zhihu.com/equation?tex=G_%7Bnp%7D\" alt=\"G_{np}\" eeimg=\"1\"/> 中，n*p为常数，所以avg deg k也为常数： </p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-0c049034fac2b291aa2b470cc0e84c43_1440w.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1052\" data-rawheight=\"531\" data-original-token=\"v2-0c049034fac2b291aa2b470cc0e84c43\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1052\" data-original=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-0c049034fac2b291aa2b470cc0e84c43_r.jpg\"/></figure><h3>Connected Components</h3><p data-pid=\"EzIuq88T\"><img src=\"https://www.zhihu.com/equation?tex=G_%7Bnp%7D%EF%BC%8Cn+%3D+100000%2C+k%3Dp%28n-1%29%3D0.5...3\" alt=\"G_{np}，n = 100000, k=p(n-1)=0.5...3\" eeimg=\"1\"/> ，Largest CC中节点占图中所有节点的比例 </p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-15c69b3c2852e3efaad6ed2ae3b5b53b_1440w.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1375\" data-rawheight=\"742\" data-original-token=\"v2-15c69b3c2852e3efaad6ed2ae3b5b53b\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1375\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-15c69b3c2852e3efaad6ed2ae3b5b53b_r.jpg\"/></figure><h2>Random Graph Model vs. MSN</h2><p data-pid=\"ppF7W2qS\">在Random Graph Model 和实际的MNS的4个核心属性对比： </p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-5d0ae7aae18bfb7261338e2e7fb8ae18_1440w.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1347\" data-rawheight=\"729\" data-original-token=\"v2-5d0ae7aae18bfb7261338e2e7fb8ae18\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1347\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-5d0ae7aae18bfb7261338e2e7fb8ae18_r.jpg\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"1BEEA8EJ\">真实网络和Random Graph类似吗 ？</p><ul><li data-pid=\"Ekwast6v\">Giant Connected component: yes</li><li data-pid=\"Inveb3g2\">Average path length: yes</li><li data-pid=\"QU706msd\">Clustering Coefficient: No</li><li data-pid=\"hR_NHvCT\">Degree Distribution: No</li></ul><h2>The Small-World Model--能同时保证high clustering且短path的图吗？</h2><figure data-size=\"normal\"><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-b2b6cede5e94e7a5fff0d0dbcfc46772_1440w.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"802\" data-rawheight=\"266\" data-original-token=\"v2-b2b6cede5e94e7a5fff0d0dbcfc46772\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"802\" data-original=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-b2b6cede5e94e7a5fff0d0dbcfc46772_r.jpg\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"4W8wCUiS\">回顾下前面MSN network，clustering coef为0.11， 而<img src=\"https://www.zhihu.com/equation?tex=G_%7Bnp%7D\" alt=\"G_{np}\" eeimg=\"1\"/> 的clustering coef为 <img src=\"https://www.zhihu.com/equation?tex=8%2A10%5E%7B-8%7D\" alt=\"8*10^{-8}\" eeimg=\"1\"/> 。 另外一个例子， IMDB数据集、Electrical power grid, Network of nerons中： </p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-1ef3c29f246e13f1fbeb0eb381c87239_1440w.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1060\" data-rawheight=\"376\" data-original-token=\"v2-1ef3c29f246e13f1fbeb0eb381c87239\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1060\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-1ef3c29f246e13f1fbeb0eb381c87239_r.jpg\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"fghJM-kU\"> 其中h：average shortest path length， C: avg clustering coefficient， random，是保证相同avg degree，相同节点下的图的情况。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-4676897b73eaf1c466b0d364599fd215_1440w.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1210\" data-rawheight=\"779\" data-original-token=\"v2-4676897b73eaf1c466b0d364599fd215\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1210\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-4676897b73eaf1c466b0d364599fd215_r.jpg\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"nTTQnOA8\">下图左边：高clustering coefficient： 朋友的朋友是我的朋友；</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-a395c389de33f0e713769685c8068c01_1440w.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"951\" data-rawheight=\"515\" data-original-token=\"v2-a395c389de33f0e713769685c8068c01\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"951\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-a395c389de33f0e713769685c8068c01_r.jpg\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"cq0p8Ehw\">Small-World同时保证high cluster and low diameter； 如下图，从high clustering/high diameter, 到low clustering/low diameter， 增加随机性（p变大）: 即随机的将一条边的另一个端点连接到任意较远的节点上，这样可以保持high clustering，low diameter； </p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-c4b7bedc3025694053c02fed5f13c833_1440w.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1165\" data-rawheight=\"801\" data-original-token=\"v2-c4b7bedc3025694053c02fed5f13c833\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1165\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-c4b7bedc3025694053c02fed5f13c833_r.jpg\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"XB61O554\"> 下图中的p区域保证保证high clustering 和low path length： </p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-bf4b7fabed8e6c7c56eb0e2579f140be_1440w.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1348\" data-rawheight=\"843\" data-original-token=\"v2-bf4b7fabed8e6c7c56eb0e2579f140be\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1348\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-bf4b7fabed8e6c7c56eb0e2579f140be_r.jpg\"/></figure><h2>Kronecker Graph Model: Generating large realistic graphs</h2><p data-pid=\"N81tLfkG\">递归的graph的生成: Self-similarity</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-311c0d67b6b97c6c8075854a8351ee82_1440w.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"798\" data-rawheight=\"235\" data-original-token=\"v2-311c0d67b6b97c6c8075854a8351ee82\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"798\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-311c0d67b6b97c6c8075854a8351ee82_r.jpg\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"PCVnZ56V\"><b>Kronecker Produce</b>是一种生成self-similar矩阵的方法： </p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-d8b887f0152532a55ec6804691b5485b_1440w.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1043\" data-rawheight=\"469\" data-original-token=\"v2-d8b887f0152532a55ec6804691b5485b\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1043\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-d8b887f0152532a55ec6804691b5485b_r.jpg\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"iJWFSVTa\"> Kronecker Product 定义如下： </p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-4f003dc0fb1ec564c58963cbd0ee2698_1440w.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"883\" data-rawheight=\"474\" data-original-token=\"v2-4f003dc0fb1ec564c58963cbd0ee2698\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"883\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-4f003dc0fb1ec564c58963cbd0ee2698_r.jpg\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"hXSNvZdw\"> 举个例子：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-e6ae8bf62392be483683f77d0d4a267d_1440w.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"784\" data-rawheight=\"309\" data-original-token=\"v2-e6ae8bf62392be483683f77d0d4a267d\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"784\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-e6ae8bf62392be483683f77d0d4a267d_r.jpg\"/></figure><ul><li data-pid=\"QLJw60Q7\">构建一个 <img src=\"https://www.zhihu.com/equation?tex=N_1+%2A+N_1\" alt=\"N_1 * N_1\" eeimg=\"1\"/> 的初始概率矩阵；</li><li data-pid=\"eTv4ISv0\">计算k阶Kronecker 矩阵；</li><li data-pid=\"msXhUH52\">遍历k阶矩阵，按<img src=\"https://www.zhihu.com/equation?tex=p_%7Buv%7D\" alt=\"p_{uv}\" eeimg=\"1\"/> 构建edge(u, v)链接 </li></ul><figure data-size=\"normal\"><img src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-89f0e4806f857239577012e2d62fdd0e_1440w.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1084\" data-rawheight=\"180\" data-original-token=\"v2-89f0e4806f857239577012e2d62fdd0e\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1084\" data-original=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-89f0e4806f857239577012e2d62fdd0e_r.jpg\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"8ds4jLYy\"> 如上图最后， 需要模拟<img src=\"https://www.zhihu.com/equation?tex=n%5E2\" alt=\"n^2\" eeimg=\"1\"/> 次，耗时太高， 是否有更高效方法(利用其递归结构)？</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-cdb77fd85b4c5452f6e44d05e7b9818d_1440w.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1062\" data-rawheight=\"652\" data-original-token=\"v2-cdb77fd85b4c5452f6e44d05e7b9818d\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1062\" data-original=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/v2-cdb77fd85b4c5452f6e44d05e7b9818d_r.jpg\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"lX5hXRb9\">真实网络与Kronecker网络很相似， 右上角为其初始矩阵：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-1f42886b7dcf6a24160218fd63c7fd99_1440w.jpg\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1059\" data-rawheight=\"640\" data-original-token=\"v2-1f42886b7dcf6a24160218fd63c7fd99\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1059\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-1f42886b7dcf6a24160218fd63c7fd99_r.jpg\"/></figure><p></p>","zhihuUrl":"http://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/261156808"}